hadiths[54]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2036","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jab Allah Taala kisi bandey sey mohabbat karta hai to usey duniya sey isi tarah bachata hai, jis tarah tum mein sey koi aadmi apney bimar ko pani sey bachata hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- ye hadees Mehmood bin Labid key wastey sey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey mursal tareeqe sey aai hai. 3- is bab mein Suheb aur Umme Munzir Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2037","Usamah bin Sharik (razi Allahu anhu) ne farmaya: \nKuch Badwiyon ne poocha: \Ya Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam)"","" kya hum ilaaj karein?\"" \nAap (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \""Haan.\"""""""
"2038","Aishah (radiyAllahu anha) ne riwayat ki: \Jab bhi RasoolAllah (sallAllahu alaihi wasallam) ki koi biimaar (bimaar) ho jaati"""""
"2039","Uqbah bin Amir Al-Juhani (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Apne bimaron ko khane par zabardasti na karo.\"""""""
"2040","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Is kalon ke beej ka istemal karo"","" kyunke is mein har bimari ka ilaaj hai"","" siwaaye As-Sam ke.\"" Aur As-Sam maut hai."""""
"2041","Hazrat Anas (Razi Allahu Anhu) ne riwayat farmaya ke: \Urainah ki qaum ke kuch log Madina Munawwara mein aaye.\"""""""
"2042","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat farmate hain: \Jo shakhs apne aap ko (kisi) aahad (lohe ke aalat) se maar le...\"""""""
"2043","Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jo shakhs apne aap ko (kisi) aahan (lohe) ki cheez se maar le...\"""""""
"2044","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki: \Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khabeesh (napaak) ilaaj se mana farmaya.\"" [Abu Elsa (rahmatullah alaihi) ne farmaya: Yani zehir.]"""""
"2045","Simak ne riwayat ki keh unhone 'Alqamah bin Wa'il se suna jo apne baap (Wa'il) se naql karte hain."
"2046","Ibn 'Abbas (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Beshak behtareen cheez jisse tum ilaaj karte ho woh As-Sa'ut hai.\"""""""
"2047","Ibn 'Abbas (r.a.) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (s.a.w.) ne farmaya: \Beshak behtareen cheez jisse tum ilaaj karte ho woh As-Sa'ut hai.\"""""""
"2048","Imran bin Husain (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne daakhnay (cauterization) se mana farmaya. Unhon ne kaha: \Hum (bimari ki sakht azmaish) mein mubtala kiye gaye"","" to hum ne daakhnay lagwaye.\"""""""
"2049","Anas (R.A) ne riwayat ki: \Nabi Kareem (S.A.W) ne As'ad bin Zurarah (R.A) ke liye Shawkah (ek qism ki bimari) ke liye daaag (cauterization) lagwaya.\"""""""
"2050","Anas (R.A.) ne riwayat ki: \Nabi Kareem (S.A.W.) apni gardan ki rag aur apne upper back par hijama (cupping) karwate tha. Aur woh satrawein (17th) tareekh ko hijama karwate thay.\"""""""
"2051","Ibn Mas'ud (R.A) ne farmaya: \Rasool Allah (S.A.W) ne Shab-e-Isra' ke baare mein hadees bayan farmai.\"""""""
"2052","Abbad bin Mansur ne 'Ikrimah se riwayat ki, unhone farmaya: \n\Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنہما) ke teen ladke the jo hijamat (cupping) karte thay. Woh un mein se do ke aamdani ko apne liye aur apne ghar walon ke liye istemal karte thay.\"""""""
"2053","Ali bin Ubaidullah ne apni daadi [Salma] (rzy allh anha) say rwayt ky hay jw nby akrm (sly allh alyh wslm) ky khdmt kya krty thyn۔ anhwn nay frmaya: \rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) kay jsm mbark pr kwy zkhm ya kt hwta tw aap mjhay hna lganay ka hkm frmatay۔\"" ayk awr snd say bhy asy trh ky rwayt mrwy hay۔"""""
"2054","Aqqar bin Al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah (raziyallahu anhu) ne apne walid se riwayat ki, unhone kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jis shakhs ne daag (cauterization / jala kar ilaaj) se ilaaj karwaya...\"""""""
"2055","Anas (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aqrab (bichchu) ke dand ke liye rukhsat (ijazat) di."
"2056","Imran bin Husain (R.A) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (S.A.W) ne farmaya: \Ruqyah sirf ayn (buri nazar) aur bichchho ke daan ke siwa jaiz nahi.\"""""""
"2057","Abu Sa'eed (R.A.) ne riwayat ki ke: \Rasool Allah (S.A.W.) jinnat aur insaan ki nazar se panah maangte the.\"""""""
"2058","Asma' bint 'Umaish ne farmaya: \Maine kaha: 'Ya Rasool Allah (S.A.W)! Ja'far ki baaz bachchon mein aankhon ki soorat mein tez tarrahi se jalan (iltahab) ho rahi hai.'\"""""""
"2059","Ibn 'Abbas (R.A) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (S.A.W) Hazrat Hasan (R.A) aur Hazrat Husain (R.A) ke liye hamesha is dua se panah maangte the:\n\n**\U'idhukuma bikalimatillahi-tammati\""**\n\n*(Main tum dono ko Allah ki mukammal kalimat ki panah deta hoon)*"""""
"2060","Hayyah bin Habis At-Tamimi ne riwayat ki: Mere ne kaha ke unhone Rasool Allah (s.a.w) ko farmate hue suna: \Al-Ham ke liye kuch nahi hai.\"""""""
"2061","Ibn 'Abbas (raziyallahu 'anhuma) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \n\Agar koi cheez muqaddar (taqdeer) par ghalib aa sakti"","" to nazar (buri nazar) us par ghalib aa jaati.\"""""""
"2062","Abu Sa‘eed (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki:\n\n\Rasoolullah (صلى الله عليه وسلم) ne ek ghazwa (lashkar) mein humein bheja. Hum kisi qaum ke paas theharay aur unhone humein mehmaan nawazi ki guzari ki"","" lekin unhone humein mehmaan nawazi nahi ki. Unke sardar ko bichchu ne kaata"","" to woh humare paas aaye aur kaha: 'Kya tum mein se koi aisa hai jo Ruqyah (dua se ilaaj) se bichchu ke kaatne ka ilaaj kar sakta hai?' Maine kaha: 'Haan"","" main kar sakta hoon. Lekin main koi Ruqyah nahi karunga jab tak tum humein kuch bakriyan na do.' Unhone kaha: 'Hum tumhein tees bakriyan denge.' Humne yeh qabool kiya.\"""""""
"2063","Abu Sa'eed Al Khudri (R.A.) ne riwayat ki: \nSahaba-e-Kiraam (R.A.) ki ek jama'at Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke ek qabeelay se mili, lekin unhone mehmaan nawazi nahi ki."
"2064","Abu Khizamah ne apne baap se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: \Maine Rasool Allah (S.A.W) se poocha: 'Aey Allah ke Rasool (S.A.W)! Kya aap is baat ko pasand karte hain ke hum jin tawizat (Ruqyah) ka istemal karte hain..."""""
"2065","Abu Hurairah (R.A) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (S.A.W) ne farmaya: \Al-Ajwah Jannat se hai aur is mein zehar ka ilaaj hai. Truffles (کھمبی) Mann (منّ) ki ek surat hain.\"""""""
"2066","Sa'eed bin Zaid (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Khama (truffles) manna ki ek qism hain.\"""""""
"2067","Abu Hurairah (R.A) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (S.A.W) ke Sahaba (R.A) mein se kuch log kehte the: \Khamaar zameen ki chhoti haazri hai.\"" Lekin Rasool Allah (S.A.W) ne farmaya: \""Khamaar mann ki ek qism hai.\"""""""
"2068","Qatadah ne farmaya: \Mujh se riwayat ki gayi ke Abu Hurairah (R.A.) ne farmaya: 'Maine teen truffles (khumbiyan) liin...'\"""""""
"2069","Qatadah ne farmaya: \Mujhe yeh riwayat ki gayi ke Abu Hurairah (Razi Allah un se) ne farmaya: 'Ash-Shuniz har bimari ka ilaaj hai"","" siwaaye As-Sam ke.' Qatadah ne kaha: \""Rozana ek seedhi (21) dane liye jaate hain.\"""""""
"2070","Abu Masud Al-Ansari (R.A) ne riwayat farmaya ke Rasool Allah (S.A.W) ne kutte ki qeemat (kharid o farokht) se mana farmaya."
"2071","Eisa ibn Abdur-Rahman bin Abi Laila ne farmaya: \Main Abdullah ibn Ukaim Abu Mabad Al-Juhani (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas unki iyadat ke liye gaya."""""
"2072","Rafi' bin Khadij (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Bukhar aag ke taraphed se hai.\"""""""
"2073","Hazrat Aishah (R.A.) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (S.A.W.) ne farmaya: \Bukhar Jahannam ki garmini se hota hai.\"""""""
"2074","# Tarjama-e-Hadith (Scholarly Roman Urdu)\n\n**Bundār, Ahmad ibn Manīʿ, aur Mahmūd ibn Ghaylān** ne hamari taraf se riwāyat bayaan ki. Unhon ne kaha: **Abū Ahmad al-Zubayrī** ne hamari taraf se riwāyat ki, wo **Sufyān** se, wo **Abū Ishāq** se, wo **Abū al-Ahwas** se, wo apne walid se, jinhon ne farmāya:\n\nMaine kāha, \Yā Rasūlallāh ﷺ! Ek ādmī mere paas se guzarta hai aur mujhe mehmān nawāzī nahi karta"","" na koi karam karta hai"","" phir woh mere paas se guzarta hai — kyā main uska badla doon?\"" Aap ﷺ ne farmāya: **\""Nahi"","" usse mehmān nawāzī karo.\""**\n\nUnhon ne kaha: \""Aur Aap ﷺ ne mujhe phaṭe hue libās pehne dekhā aur farmāya"","" 'Kya tumhārā koi māl hai?' Maine kāha"","" 'Allāh taʿālā ne mujhe har qism ke māl se maldār bana diya — ūnt aur bakriyāṅ hain.' Aap ﷺ ne farmāya: **'Toh woh tum par zāhir ho jāe.'\""**\n\n**Abū ʿĪsā** (al-Tirmidhī) ne farmāya: Is mawḍūʿ par **ʿĀʾishah**"","" **Jābir**"","" aur **Abū Hurayrah** (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhum ajmaʿīn) se bhi riwāyāt hain.\n\nAur yeh **hasan sahīh** hadīth hai. **Abū al-Ahwas** ka naam **ʿAwf ibn Mālik ibn Nadalah al-Jushamī** hai.\n\nAur Aap ﷺ ke irshād **\""aqrihi\""** kā matlab hai **\""adifhu\""** — yāni **\""usse mehmān nawāzī karo.\""** Aur **al-qirā** ("""""
"2075","Aishah (R.A) ne Wahb ki beti Judamah (R.A) se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: \Maine Rasoolullah (S.A.W) ko farmate suna: 'Maine Al-Ghilah (ghila) se mana karna chaha.'\"""""""
"2076","Aisha (R.A) ne Judama bint Wahb Asadiyyah (R.A) se riwayat ki ke unhone Rasoolullah (S.A.W) ko farmaate suna:\n\n\Main Ghilah (ghila) se mana karne ka irada kiya"","" lekin jab maine socha ke aurat ke shohar ke saath uske bachche ko doodh pilane ke dauraan uska bacha gir jaaye to yeh Farsi aur Roman (Rum) logon mein bhi hota hai"","" to maine mana nahi kiya.\"""""""
"2077","Qatadah ne Abu Abdullah se riwayat ki, aur Zaid bin Arqam ne farmaya ke: \nNabi ﷺ ne zaitoon ka tel aur Wars (ek qism ki dawa) ko zaat-ur-riq (pleurisy) ke ilaaj ke liye tajweiz farmaee. Qatadah ne kaha: \n\Is dawa ko us taraf ke munh mein lagaya jaata hai jis taraf bimari ho.\"""""""
"2078","Maimoon Abu Abdullah ne farmaya: \Maine Zaid bin Arqam (R.A) se suna"","" unhone kaha: Rasoolullah (S.A.W) ne humein hukm diya ke Qust Al-Bahri aur tel ka istemal karke pleurisy ka ilaaj kiya jaye.\"""""""
"2079","Uthman bin Abi Al-'As (R.A) ne riwayat farmayi: \Rasool Allah (S.A.W) mere paas aaye jab mujhe ek dard tha jo mujh khatam hone par tha. To"""""
"2080","Hazrat Asma' bint 'Umais (R.A) ne riwayat farmaya ke Rasoolullah (S.A.W) ne un se poochha ke woh ishaal ke liye kya istemal karti hain. Unhon ne kaha: \Shubrum.\"" Aap (S.A.W) ne farma yeh garmah aur bahut tez hai. Unhon ne kaha: \""Phir maine ishaal ke liye Senna istemal kiya.\"" Tab Nabi (S.A.W) ne farma: \""Agar koi cheez jo maut ka ilaaj hoti"","" toh woh yahi hoti.\"""""""
"2081","Abu Sa'eed (R.A.) ne farmaya: \Ek shakhs Nabi Kareem (S.A.W.) ke paas aaya aur arz ki: 'Mere bhai ko dast (loose bowels) ho rahe hain.' Aap (S.A.W.) ne farmaya: 'Usey shahad (honey) pilao.' To us ne shahad pi liya. Phir woh dobara aaya aur arz ki: 'Ya Rasool Allah (S.A.W.)! Us ne shahad pi liya.'\"""""""
"2082","Ibn 'Abbas (R.A) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (S.A.W) ne farmaya: \Koi bhi Musalmaan bandah jo kisi bimare ko uske inteqaal ke waqt ke siwa ziyarat kare aur saat baar yeh du'a padhe: As'alullah Al-'Azeem"","" Rabbal 'Arshil 'Azeem"","" an yashfik (Main Allah Ta'ala Azeem"","" Arsh-e-Azeem ke Rab se tera shifa mangta hoon)"","" to Allah Ta'ala usay zaroor shifa ata farmata hai - jab tak woh us din marne ke waqt tak zinda rehne ke liye.\"""""""
"2083","Thawban (R.A) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (S.A.W) ne farmaya: \Jab tum mein se kisi ko bukhar ho - aur bukhar to aag ka ek tukda hai - to use paani se bujhaye. Woh ek behne wali darya ke saamne"","" uski taraf mun karke khada ho aur yeh padhe: 'Bismillah. Allahumma ishfi 'abdaka wa saddiq Rasulak' (Allah ke naam se. Aye Allah! Apne bande ko shifa de aur Apne Rasool ki tasdeeq kar).' Isko Fajr ki namaz ke baad aur suraj ugne se pehle padhe. Woh teen baar us mein dubke."""""
"2084","# Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\n**Mahmūd ibn Ghaylān** ne riwāyat karte hue farmāyā: **Abū Dāwūd** ne hamāre ḥāẓiriyoṅ ko bayān kiyā: **Shuʿbah** ne hamāre ḥāẓiriyoṅ ko ittilāʿ dī, **Abū Isḥāq** se, jo farmāte haiṅ: Maiṅ ne **Abū ʿAbdillāh al-Jadalī** se sunā, jo farmāte haiṅ:\n\n\Maiṅ ne **ʿĀ'ishah** (Allāh un se raẓī ho) se **Rasūlullāh** (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ke akhlāq ke bāre meṅ pūchhā. Unhoṅ ne jawāb diya:\n\n'Woh **na to bāt-cīt meṅ fāḥish** (*fāḥish*) the"","" na **fāḥish bāt karne kī koshish karne wāle** (*mutafaḥḥish*)"","" aur na **bāzāroṅ meṅ zor se chillāne wāle** (*ṣakhkhāb fī al-aswāq*) the. Woh **burāī kā badle burāī nahiṅ dete the; balke maʿāf karte aur darguzar karte the** (*yaʿfū wa yaṣfaḥ*).'\""\n\n**Abū ʿĪsā** (al-Tirmidhī) ne farmāyā: *\""Yeh ḥasan ṣaḥīḥ hadith hai.\""*\n\n**Abū ʿAbdillāh al-Jadalī** kā nām **ʿAbd ibn ʿAbd** hai"","" aur yeh bhī kahā jātā hai **ʿAbd al-Raḥmān ibn ʿAbd**.\n\n---\n\n*Yeh riwāyat Sunan al-Tirmidhī meṅ darj hai aur is kā darja Ḥasan Ṣaḥīh hai. Yeh ḥadīth Nabī Muḥammad (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ke ʿālī janāb akhlāq kā ḥusn-e-taḥrīr se bayān kartī hai"","" jis meṅ un kī parhez-gārī"","" shān aur sakhāwat-numāī kā zikr hai.*"""""
"2085","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (R.A) se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah (S.A.W) ne farmaya: \Mareez ki misal jab woh shifa paye aur sehat aaye"","" us barish ki misal hai jo aasmaan ki pakeezgi aur rang ke saath girta hai.\"""""""
"2086","Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (R.A) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (S.A.W) ne farmaya: \Jab tum mein se koi bhi kisi mareez ko jaye to...\"""""""
"2087","Abu Hurairah (R.A) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (S.A.W) ne ek bimare (bimmar) mard ka mulakaat kiya."
"2088","Abu Hurairah (R.A) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (S.A.W) ne farmaya: \Jis shakhs ne maal chhod kar gaye"","" to woh uski warison ke liye hai.\"""""""
"2089","Abu Hurairah (R.A) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (S.A.W) ne farmaya: \Wirasat ke ahkaam aur Quran seekh lo.\"""""""
